          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wakhuluma ezinhloko zezizwe ngabantwana bakwa-Israyeli, wathi: “Nansi indaba uJehova ayale ngayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma umuntu enza isithembiso kuJehova, noma efunga isifungo sokubopha umphefumulo wakhe ngebhande; ngeke aphule izwi lakhe, kufanele enze ngokuvumelana nakho konke okuphuma emlonyeni wakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma owesifazane enza isithembiso kuJehova, azibophe ngesibopho esendlini kayise ebusheni bakhe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyise uyasilalela isithembiso sakhe nesibopho sakhe abophe ngaso umphefumulo wakhe, uyise athule kuye; zonke izithembiso zakhe ziyakuma, nazo zonke izibopho abophe ngazo umphefumulo wakhe ziyakuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uma uyise emala ngosuku akuzwa ngalo; akuyikuba khona nesisodwa sezithembiso zakhe noma sezibopho zakhe abophe ngazo umphefumulo wakhe; uJehova uyakuyithethelela, ngokuba uyise emyalile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uma enendoda, lapho ebophe isithembiso, noma esho utho oluphuma emlonyeni wakhe abophe ngakho umphefumulo wakhe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
