              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezi ziyizimiso uJehova ayala ngazo uMose phakathi kwendoda nomkayo, phakathi kukayise nendodakazi yakhe isebusheni bayo endlini kayise.",
          "type": "text",
